    "detailed_description": "<strong>CASTLE MASTER TD </strong><br><br>Fortify, Strategize, and Conquer in our dynamic tower defense game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622400/extras/6a5ac9404e44b7051563579f0b485e11.poster.avif?t=1697608938\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622400/extras/6a5ac9404e44b7051563579f0b485e11.webm?t=1697608938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622400/extras/6a5ac9404e44b7051563579f0b485e11.mp4?t=1697608938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As master of your own castle, you\u2019ll build powerful structures, plan strategic defences, and engage in epic battles against relentless enemies. <br>Each choice you make shapes your kingdom\u2019s destiny. <br><br>Rise to the challenge, display your strategic prowess, and ensure your castle\u2019s survival against all odds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622400/extras/40058d4bd5bde73d2c76aeb0681f9dd2.poster.avif?t=1697608938\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622400/extras/40058d4bd5bde73d2c76aeb0681f9dd2.webm?t=1697608938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2622400/extras/40058d4bd5bde73d2c76aeb0681f9dd2.mp4?t=1697608938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This isn\u2019t just a game \u2013 it\u2019s a test of strength, strategy, and survival!<br><br><strong>Awesome Features:</strong><br><br>Castle Master TD combines the nostalgic charm of Tetris-like gameplay with the strategic depth of a tower defence game. Players build their castle using falling blocks, each with its unique defensive function, and strategically place knights and defensive machines to fend off waves of enemies.",
